WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Dana Cole>Thanks for making time. We want to lock renewal pricing before Q1.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Alex Rivera>We can offer a two-year term at the current rate, with a 5 percent discount if signed by December 15th.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Dana Cole>That works. I'll take it to procurement and get back to you by November 7th.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.000
<v Alex Rivera>Agreed then: two-year term, current rate, 5 percent off if signed by December 15th. I'll send the formal quote tomorrow.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Dana Cole>One question: does the discount apply to add-on seats too?

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.000
<v Alex Rivera>Good question, I'll need to check with our finance team.
